        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">4. Sister Sizing Physics: Identical Volume on Different Bodies</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-body mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Sister sizes are sizes that hold the <strong>exact same cup volume</strong>, but are paired with different ribcage band measurements. If you increase the band size, you must decrease the cup letter to preserve identical volume.
        </p>
      </div>

