          <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Breast tissue bulges over the top rim or underarm edges of the cup, forming a double curve under clothing.
          </p>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-danger">Fix: Go up 1 to 2 cup sizes.</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Gaping -->
        <div class="p-5 bg-canvas rounded-xl border border-hairline flex flex-col items-center text-center">
