          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink text-base mb-1">2. Cup Gaping &amp; Wrinkling</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Hollow empty gaps appear at the top of the cup, or fabric folds when you sit down.
          </p>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent">Fix: Size down in cup, or switch from molded to unlined seamed cups.</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Band Riding Up -->
