          <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed mb-3">
            The band forms an upward arch across your spine rather than anchoring straight and horizontal to the floor.
          </p>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-danger">Fix: Size down in band (e.g., 36 to 34) and up in cup.</span>
        </div>

