      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">6. Why Breast Shape Dictates Visual Appearance</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-body leading-relaxed mb-5">
        Two people with the exact same 34D measurements can look visually unalike because of how breast tissue is anchored to the chest wall:
      </p>

